@startuml
title Resumefolio | Live presentation and submitted materials
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
}
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Professional profile\nReusable professional information" as profile
rectangle "Tailored resume\nIndependent selections, layout and overrides" as resume
rectangle "Live employer view\nSelected content + permitted PDF/file retrieval" as live
rectangle "Record actual submission\nCapture trigger and artifact details need definition" as capture #FEF3C7
rectangle "Preserved submitted materials\nResume and cover letter actually submitted" as submitted #DCFCE7
rectangle "User-identified actual artifacts\nResume + cover letter actually sent" as actual #FEF3C7
rectangle "Application history\nRelevant opportunity and progress context" as history #DCFCE7
profile --> resume : intended reuse / updates under explicit rules
resume --> live : controlled sharing
resume ..> capture : only if this is the actual submitted material
actual --> capture : identify / validate actual set
capture --> submitted : preserve actual submitted material
submitted --> history : retained submission context
note right of live
Later saved changes may be reflected
under explicit requirements.
Direct retrieval remains authorized.
end note
note right of submitted
Later source edits do not overwrite
the preserved submitted copies.
Deletion, correction and restoration
rules still require specification.
end note
legend bottom
Conceptual information boundaries; no storage design or automatic propagation selected.
Cover letter capture is part of the submission context; it does not originate from the profile.
The diagram does not define retention periods, access sessions or accepted detailed policies.
endlegend
@enduml
